<title>MEXICO: RESEARCH ALERT - Nadro raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Nadro raised to buy.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican brokerage Accival said on Monday it raised its recommendation on pharmaceutical company Nadro to buy from neutral.</p>
<p>-- &quot;We expect good results for the second quarter will continue to boost Nadro's price,&quot; analyst Cecilia Del Castillo said in a report.</p>
<p>-- The company's shares stood at 29.10 pesos in afternoon trading, up 30 centavos from Friday's close.</p>
<p>((--Mexico City newsroom +525 728-7903))</p>
</text>
